    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the World Went Dark is a turn-based RPG roguelike with a node-based traversal system. Every item you equip gives you a unique ability to combat the forces of the darkness as you make your way in this dying world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your four party characters react differently to the items you give them. Your choices shape how they recover their memories and grow as individuals.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the World Went Dark is a turn-based RPG roguelike with a node-based traversal system. Every item you equip gives you a unique ability to combat the forces of the darkness as you make your way in this dying world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your four party characters react differently to the items you give them. Your choices shape how they recover their memories and grow as individuals.</p>",
    "short_description": "Uncover the pasts of your four party members in this \u201cyou are what you wear\u201d turn-based roguelike. Grow your skill, gather new items, and answer one simple question: Which is more important, victory, or the people who can get you there?",
